# Repos a reviewer of THIS repo may search and cite, materialized under
# .siblings/<owner>/<repo>. Declared rather than left to the fallback so
# the set is the one this repo actually depends on.
#
# One per line. The reviewer host must also carry a SOURCE_PATHS entry for
# each, or the sibling reports as `missing` and is never searched.
#
# Each row is a real edge: `plow-hermes-agent` is the base this image builds
# FROM; `plow` owns the API the poller and cron call (PLOW_API_BASE,
# /v1/chats/.../messages); `agent-index-client` owns the client the
# Dockerfile pins (vendor/client.pin); and `plow-agents` is the CLI
# docs/INSTALL.md walks the owner through (login, lines, mint, revoke).
# Latch is not listed: this agent uses the X API, not the owner's Mac.

plow-pbc/plow-hermes-agent
plow-pbc/plow
plow-pbc/agent-index-client
plow-pbc/plow-agents
